  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal model compared to concat fusion (experiment 001), achieving validation accuracy of 0.5232 (vs 0.5266) and similar F1. The slight decrease in accuracy suggests weighted fusion may not improve performance over concat, but the small difference and similar F1 indicate uncertainty about its impact. Further experiments are needed to isolate fusion's effect and compare against other design choices."
}

